    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Bridge discipline",
      "items": [
        "T-C02: one pair, one transaction, one entry point; reconciliation and review findings are preserved verbatim in GlmOcrBridgeRecord (V13) — nothing discarded",
        "T-011: papers land as ExamPaper → Question → Version → Part → MarkScheme → MarkPoint, all SUGGESTED, with an ingestion-anchor topic (UNVALIDATED) remapped during review",
        "T-013: validate → checksum dedup → JSONB → deterministic chunks — never embeds at ingest",
        "T-010: whole-draft single transaction; identical provenance fingerprint re-ingests as a no-op; prerequisite edges are never derived"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Validation honesty",
      "items": [
        "Everything ingestion creates lands SUGGESTED or UNVALIDATED with full provenance",
        "Only teacher/SME review promotes: validate · reject · flag — a flagged scheme never backs marking",
        "SME packages are the exception that proves the rule: their schemes arrive VALIDATED because a human authored them"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Paused & prepared",
      "items": [
        "v2 content posture: the books band (ADR-BOOK-0001, migration 0005) and the ADR-037 v0.7 official-paper lane (markPoints persist per point) deliver content through lane-side tooling and this fabric; the books vector arm is APPLY-READY of record (Session 207)",
        "Content embedding lane serving rev2; /embed stays re-runnable; T-C20 keeps search VALIDATED-only",
